- The **Root Mean Square Error (RMSE)** of the trend model averages `get_summary_value("rmse", "mean")`{python exec} m, indicating the typical deviation between observed points and the fitted trend line.

::: else

**Note:** Trend analysis data is not available for this site. This may indicate insufficient temporal data for trend calculations.

:::

